otengine/godot/pull/99479.patch","merged_at":"2025-02-18T13:56:53Z"},"body":"This project conversion affects only projects, that were edited after #97707 (v4.4-dev4) and provides an easy way to upgrade these projects.\r\n\r\nIt seems reasonable to assume, that at that time of the next stable Godot-release all affected projects have been converted.\r\nSo I would like to suggest to merge this PR and remove the project conversion shortly before the next stable release,\r\n\r\nFor projects, that haven't been converted, we can provide an upgrade-strategy, that that consists of opening the project once with v4.4-dev5.\r\n\r\nFollow-up to/Implements https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99449#pullrequestreview-2449032498\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99479/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99479/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}